# VS Code extension "REST Client" (humao.rest-client): click "Send Request" above any request.
# Everything goes through the gateway. Create api-tests/.env or use "REST Client: Switch Environment" -> add in settings:
#   "rest-client.environmentVariables": { "local": { "base": "http://localhost:18080", "password": "<your seed password>" } }
# Never commit your password.

@base = {{$dotenv base}}

### 1. Login as a customer (copy accessToken into the variable below)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "cust00001@connectone.test", "password": "{{$dotenv password}}" }

###
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 2. Public: recharge plans (cached when Redis is on)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/recharge-plans

### 3. My profile / numbers / payments
GET {{base}}/api/v1/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/mobile-numbers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/payments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Start a recharge (idempotencyKey must be unique per attempt; reuse it to see idempotency)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/recharges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: manual-test-0001

{ "mobileNumberId": 1, "planId": 2, "idempotencyKey": "manual-recharge-0001" }

### 5. Confirm the payment (use the paymentId from step 4). Repeat with the same callbackId: applied once.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/payments/PAYMENT_ID/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "callbackId": "manual-callback-0001", "outcome": "SUCCEEDED" }

### 6. Notifications - served by notification-service through the gateway (appears ~1-2 s after step 5)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/notifications/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Admin: dashboard, payments needing reconciliation, notification deliveries (notification-service)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/payments?reconciliation=RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/notification-deliveries?status=FAILED&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/notifications/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Negative tests
# no token -> 401
GET {{base}}/api/v1/notifications/me

###
# customer on an admin API -> 403
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# actuator must not be reachable through the gateway -> 404
GET {{base}}/actuator/metrics
